      "reason": "The methods section lists the variables for which data were sought (publication details, study setting and size, definitions of pre-pandemic and pandemic periods, and outcome rates), but these variables are not explicitly defined, and other variables evidently collected as shown in Table 1 (e.g., factors adjusted for, statistical approach, singleton/multiple gestation status, population level) and funding-related information are not listed as data items in the methods."
